<title>USA: Comcast confirms option to up E! cable stake.</title>
<headline>Comcast confirms option to up E! cable stake.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comcast Corp on Friday confirmed that it has an option to raise its current 10.4 percent stake in the E! Entertainment Television channel to 68.8 percent or divest its position.</p>
<p>The company said it is reviewing price and conditions for selling its stake in the network to Time Warner Inc or raising its ownership by buying Time Warner's 58.4 percent stake.</p>
<p>Based on the network's $550 million valuation, the purchase price of Time Warner's interest would be about $321 million, Comcast said.</p>
</text>
